  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><p style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration-thickness:auto;text-decoration-style:solid;color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">Phởzen is a small-batch Vietnamese Chili Saté brand based in Washington state. We make bold, aromatic chili saté with organic avocado oil, garlic, lemongrass, chilies, and slow-simmered Vietnamese flavors. Our sauce is made to upgrade everyday meals like noodles, rice bowls, eggs, dumplings, grilled meats, vegetables, and marinades.</span></p><p style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration-thickness:auto;text-decoration-style:solid;color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">Affiliates earn 8% commission on qualified order totals, excluding shipping, taxes, and other fees. Each partner receives a personal referral link, and approved commissions are paid monthly through PayPal or bank transfer based on the affiliate’s preference.</span></p><p style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration-thickness:auto;text-decoration-style:solid;color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">We are currently running our Spring Bundle Event, so no additional customer discount code is offered at this time. Partners can promote our existing bundle value, free gifts, recipe cards, and free shipping on qualifying orders.</span></p><p style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration-thickness:auto;text-decoration-style:solid;color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">We welcome food creators, home cooks, recipe bloggers, lifestyle creators, and anyone who genuinely loves sharing bold flavor and easy cooking inspiration.</span></p><p style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration-thickness:auto;text-decoration-style:solid;color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><a href=\"https://af.uppromote.com/phozen/register\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Sign Up Link</a></span></p></div>",
